# Build context of apps/qed-demo/Dockerfile, built from the repository root (apps/qed-demo/docs/DEPLOY.md). An allow
# list: everything is left out except the app, the two research files its readiness page reads and the five QA files
# its judge page reads (the live adversarial run and its re-run, their diagnoses and the call table). Data folders,
# databases, keys, logs, environment files and dependency folders never reach the image.
*
!apps/qed-demo/
!docs/shared/RISK_REGISTER.md
!docs/research/qed-fin-infra-compliance/20261123-jurisdiction-matrix.json
!docs/research/qed-qa-reliability/20261124-adversarial-ask-live-original30.json
!docs/research/qed-qa-reliability/20261124-adversarial-ask-live-diagnosis.json
!docs/research/qed-qa-reliability/runs/adversarial-live-calls.tsv
!docs/research/qed-qa-reliability/20261124-adversarial-ask-live-rerun.json
!docs/research/qed-qa-reliability/20261124-adversarial-ask-live-rerun-diagnosis.json
apps/qed-demo/**/node_modules
apps/qed-demo/data
apps/qed-demo/dist
apps/qed-demo/**/.env*
apps/qed-demo/**/*.db
apps/qed-demo/**/*.db-wal
apps/qed-demo/**/*.db-shm
apps/qed-demo/**/*.kek
apps/qed-demo/**/*.log
apps/qed-demo/evidence/**
!apps/qed-demo/evidence/*.json
!apps/qed-demo/evidence/*/summary.json
apps/qed-demo/browser/results
apps/qed-demo/e2e/results
apps/qed-demo/test-results
